  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 1573421056
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1640529920
    m_Localized: Tap to close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1644724224
    m_Localized: Move & Dodge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1644724225
    m_Localized: "Moving and dodging let you avoid enemy attacks.\nDodge steps you
      forward and briefly nullifies all incoming attacks.\n\n{input.device:choose(keyboard|xbox|playstation|switch):<sprite
      name=\"space\">|<sprite name=\"xa\">|<sprite name=\"px\">|<sprite name=\"nb\">}
      Dodge\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000{input.device:choose(keyboard|xbox|playstation|switch):<size=80%><sprite
      name=\"w\"><sprite name=\"a\"><sprite name=\"s\"><sprite name=\"d\"></size>|<sprite
      name=\"jl\">|<sprite name=\"jl\">|<sprite name=\"jl\">} Move"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6106260330607018183
  - m_Id: 1648918528
    m_Localized: Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918529
    m_Localized: 'Press the {input.device:choose(keyboard|xbox|playstation|switch):<sprite
      name="ml">|<sprite name="xb">|<sprite name="po">|<sprite name="na">} button
      to attack.

      There''s a wave on the bar at the bottom of the screen,

      and
      the color changes the type of attack.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6106260330607018183
  - m_Id: 1648918530
    m_Localized: Kill Chord (Skill)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918531
    m_Localized: 'By landing attacks in a row that match

      the colors of the
      hexagons

      inside the red frame, and the timing of the icons

      in
      the white frame at the bottom of the screen,

      you can trigger a special
      attack called a Kill Chord.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918532
    m_Localized: Just Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918533
    m_Localized: "If you attack exactly when the judgment bar\nat the bottom of the
      screen lines up\nwith each attack's yellow line,\nyou'll perform a \"Just Attack\"
      \u2014\nan attack stronger than normal."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918534
    m_Localized: Green Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918535
    m_Localized: 'Weapon: Rifle

      Performed by attacking on the green timing.

      A
      relatively easy-to-use attack

      that delivers stable performance

      in
      any situation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918536
    m_Localized: Orange Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918537
    m_Localized: 'Weapon: Submachine Gun

      Performed by attacking on the orange
      timing.

      A rapid, continuous attack.

      Fires 3-round bursts,

      dealing
      damage with multiple hits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918538
    m_Localized: Blue Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918539
    m_Localized: 'Weapon: Shotgun

      Performed by attacking on the blue timing.

      A
      close-range attack that covers a wide area.

      Fires a fan-shaped spread
      that can hit multiple enemies at once,

      but is less effective against
      distant targets.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918540
    m_Localized: Purple Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918541
    m_Localized: 'Weapon: Anti-Materiel Rifle

      Performed by attacking on the
      purple timing.

      High damage and long range, but slow to execute.

      The
      bullet travels in a straight line and pierces enemies,

      hitting multiple
      targets at once.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918542
    m_Localized: Light Blue Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918543
    m_Localized: 'Weapon: Revolver

      Performed by attacking on the light blue
      timing.

      An attack that combines power and suppression.

      Easily
      knocks back the target.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918544
    m_Localized: Yellow Attack
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1648918545
    m_Localized: 'Weapon: Handgun

      Performed by attacking on the yellow timing.

      A
      fast, high-power attack.

      Because of that, it''s difficult to input,

      and
      shows its true value with precise rhythm timing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
